    {
      "id": "twilite-showroom-detail",
      "type": "face",
      "label": "Product page · Detail",
      "position": {
        "x": -120,
        "y": -620
      },
      "width": 680,
      "height": 460,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "twilite-showroom",
          "nodeId": "twilite-showroom-detail"
        },
        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail",
          "scroll": "page"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:white;color:#162039;container-type:inline-size;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif\"><header style=\"background:#32116c;color:white;padding:clamp(22px,5.5cqw,66px)\"><div style=\"max-width:920px;margin:auto\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding-bottom:35px\"><b style=\"color:#f5c542;font:900 15px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em\">TWILITE</b><span style=\"color:#d4c3ec;font:700 11px system-ui\">SHOWROOM</span></div><p style=\"font:800 11px system-ui;letter-spacing:.17em;color:#f5c542\">YOUR WORK · YOUR AGENT · YOUR SPACE</p><h1 style=\"font:500 clamp(43px,8cqw,78px)/1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:25px 0;max-width:15ch\">Make it once.<br/>Keep building.</h1><p style=\"font:400 clamp(18px,2.7cqw,23px)/1.5 system-ui;max-width:37ch;color:#eadff9\">Create with your AI. Keep the work. Connect it to everything that comes next.</p><div style=\"margin:27px 0 20px\"><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/library/starters/start-with-your-ai/root.node\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 17px;margin:4px 10px 4px 0;border-radius:7px;background:#f5c542;border:1px solid #f5c542;color:#291343;font:800 14px/1.2 system-ui;text-decoration:none\">Start with your AI</a><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/root.node\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 17px;margin:4px 10px 4px 0;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #c8b6e9;color:#4c277a;font:800 14px/1.2 system-ui;text-decoration:none\">Explore the Zone</a></div><p style=\"font:600 13px/1.6 system-ui;color:#e4d6f5\">Explore the Zone free. Try the Editor free for 14 days, then $20/month. Bring your own AI agent.</p></div></header><main style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(24px,5cqw,55px) clamp(18px,4cqw,48px)\"><p style=\"font:900 12px system-ui;letter-spacing:.17em;color:#6f469d\">THREE REUSABLE EXHIBITS</p><h2 style=\"font:500 clamp(31px,5cqw,52px)/1.1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:8px 0 35px\">Start with something worth keeping.</h2><section style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:25px;padding:29px 0;border-top:1px solid #ded8e9\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 310px\"><div style=\"font:800 11px system-ui;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#7453a5\">01 · KEEP THE WORK</div><h3 style=\"font:500 clamp(25px,4cqw,39px)/1.15 Georgia,serif;margin:9px 0 13px\">Keep what you and your AI make</h3><p style=\"font:400 16px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569\">Take the plan, draft, or decision out of the endless chat scroll. Keep it as a file you own, revisit, edit, and connect to future work.</p><p style=\"font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#665483\">For people who use AI for real work</p></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-height:152px;background:#f0ebff;padding:22px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #d5cbe6;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between\"><b style=\"font:800 11px system-ui;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#68498e\">REAL GRAPH · EXAMPLE 01</b><strong style=\"font:500 23px Georgia,serif;color:#2e2440\">Keep AI work</strong><a href=\"github://mikemartinez1974/public/why/twilite/root.node\" style=\"font:800 13px system-ui;color:#633c96\">See an example →</a></div></section><section style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:25px;padding:29px 0;border-top:1px solid #ded8e9\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 310px\"><div style=\"font:800 11px system-ui;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#7453a5\">02 · STAY CONNECTED</div><h3 style=\"font:500 clamp(25px,4cqw,39px)/1.15 Georgia,serif;margin:9px 0 13px\">See the whole project. Zoom into any part.</h3><p style=\"font:400 16px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569\">Bring goals, tasks, decisions, and unanswered questions into a connected project. See what depends on what without switching between scattered apps.</p><p style=\"font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#665483\">For people building or running projects</p></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-height:152px;background:#fff3df;padding:22px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #d5cbe6;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between\"><b style=\"font:800 11px system-ui;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#68498e\">REAL GRAPH · EXAMPLE 02</b><strong style=\"font:500 23px Georgia,serif;color:#2e2440\">The Twilite project</strong><a href=\"github://mikemartinez1974/public/projects/twilite/root.node\" style=\"font:800 13px system-ui;color:#633c96\">Explore the project →</a></div></section><section style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:25px;padding:29px 0;border-top:1px solid #ded8e9\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 310px\"><div style=\"font:800 11px system-ui;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#7453a5\">03 · MAKE A PLACE</div><h3 style=\"font:500 clamp(25px,4cqw,39px)/1.15 Georgia,serif;margin:9px 0 13px\">Make something people can actually use</h3><p style=\"font:400 16px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569\">Make a showroom, a company page, a tutorial, or an interactive environment. The graph isn't just a diagram of the thing. It can become the thing you share.</p><p style=\"font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#665483\">For creators, educators, and small businesses</p></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-height:152px;background:#e8f7f3;padding:22px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #d5cbe6;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between\"><b style=\"font:800 11px system-ui;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#68498e\">REAL GRAPH · EXAMPLE 03</b><strong style=\"font:500 23px Georgia,serif;color:#2e2440\">Blusheree showroom</strong><a href=\"github://mikemartinez1974/public/blusheree/root.node\" style=\"font:800 13px system-ui;color:#633c96\">See a showroom →</a></div></section></main><section style=\"padding:clamp(26px,5cqw,60px);background:#142039;color:white\"><div style=\"max-width:900px;margin:auto\"><p style=\"font:900 12px system-ui;color:#f5c542;letter-spacing:.16em\">THE IDEA UNDERNEATH</p><h2 style=\"font:500 clamp(32px,6cqw,58px)/1.08 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:12px 0 20px\">Build with nodes.<br/>Make your own or use someone else's.</h2><p style=\"font:400 17px/1.7 system-ui;color:#d6deef;max-width:63ch\">A Twilite graph is a structured document made of nodes and their relationships. Nodes describe ideas, objects, and capabilities. You can create nodes yourself or use published building blocks. The same model grows from a single piece of information to projects, publications, and navigable places.</p><p style=\"font:400 17px/1.7 system-ui;color:#d6deef;max-width:63ch\">Pages are documents you usually visit. Nodes are described inside graph documents and can be consumed in other contexts. They can have their own identity, surfaces, and exposed interfaces.</p><a href=\"github://mikemartinez1974/public/why/how-it-fits/root.node\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 17px;margin:4px 10px 4px 0;border-radius:7px;background:#f5c542;border:1px solid #f5c542;color:#291343;font:800 14px/1.2 system-ui;text-decoration:none\">See how the pieces fit</a></div></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:50px 30px\"><p style=\"font:900 11px system-ui;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#7453a5\">THE PROOF IS THE PLACE</p><h2 style=\"font:500 45px/1.1 Georgia,serif;margin:14px 0\">The Twilite Zone is made with Twilite.</h2><p style=\"font:400 17px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569\">Visit the Gallery, browse real graphs, and learn by using the same environment that created them.</p><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/gallery/root.node\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 17px;margin:4px 10px 4px 0;border-radius:7px;background:#f5c542;border:1px solid #f5c542;color:#291343;font:800 14px/1.2 system-ui;text-decoration:none\">Visit the Gallery</a><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/tutorial/root.node\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 17px;margin:4px 10px 4px 0;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #c8b6e9;color:#4c277a;font:800 14px/1.2 system-ui;text-decoration:none\">Learn in the Tutorial</a></section><footer style=\"background:#21113c;color:#e1d4f2;padding:22px 38px;font:600 12px system-ui\">Brainstorm source: github://mikemartinez1974/public/why/brainstorm/root.node</footer></div>"
        }
      }
    },
